            </a>{" "}
            with the goal of improving readability and understandability. Some
            SVG icons are sourced from{" "}
            <a href="https://tabler.io/icons" class="nowrap">
                <img src="/assets/icons/tabler.svg" alt="" class="icon" />
                Tabler.io
            </a>
            .
        </p>
    </section>
</footer>
